        "id": 1086611
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-03-20T03:50:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After working on this feature, I think it makes more sense to separate out whitelist and blacklist update, and don\u0027t do it via one HAL API call. About to talk to QCOM on this change. Also I spoke with Lorenzo and Erik when there were here last time, seems like compiling a whitelist won\u0027t happen in O. \n\nWith above said I\u0027d like to keep the function name as is so it is clear that this only touches BSSID blacklist.",
